# Raging Battle Mouse: the Celebration condition (CR 207.2c, 603.4) is checked each turn at the beginning of combat. Turn 1: a
# Black Lotus and the Mouse entered, so Bot1 pumps the Mouse. Turn 3: Bot1 plays a Mountain and casts a Memnite: a land doesn't
# count, so one nonland permanent (and the Mouse and Lotus from turn 1 don't count either): no trigger, the Mouse stays a 2/1.
# Turn 5: Bot1 casts a Mox Ruby and a Mox Pearl, the second nonland permanent: the trigger happens. The target must be a creature
# Bot1 controls: Bot2's Ornithopter is refused (CR 115.1, 601.2c) and Bot1 pumps its Memnite, a 2/2 for the turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Raging Battle Mouse
Memnite
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

